| Hunt 4: T1053.005 - Scheduled Task Created
| Author: Wamba José
| Logic: schtasks.exe /create (Sysmon EventCode 1)

index=endpoint source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
Image="*\\schtasks.exe" CommandLine="*/create*"
| table _time host User ParentImage CommandLine

| Correlation (Windows Security 4698, requires auditpol "Other Object Access Events"):
| index=endpoint source="*Security*" EventCode=4698
| | table _time host Account_Name Task_Name
